<p>算法SDK导入是独立身份：</p>
<ul>
<li><code>D:\Program Files\VisionMaster4.4.0\MVDAlgorithmSDK\Runtime\x64\MVDFastFeaturePatMatchCpp.dll</code> SHA256 <code>04edca3a7d5f100983e0aaadb31f58149ae06bee31939831f77f5634b3de63d7</code>；仅PE导入/导出，不代表其方法体已还原。</li>
